flowchart TD
  Report([Bug reported]) --> Repro{Can reproduce?}
  Repro -->|yes| Severity{Critical?}
  Severity -->|yes| Hotfix[Ship hotfix]
  Hotfix --> Verify[Verify fix]
  Verify --> Close([Closed])
  Severity -->|no| Backlog[Add to backlog]
  Backlog --> Close
  Repro -->|no| NeedInfo[Request more info]
  NeedInfo --> Repro
  Logs[(Error logs)] -.-> Repro
  Runbook[(Triage runbook)] -.-> Severity

  %% @main Report Repro Severity Hotfix Verify Close
  %% @retry NeedInfo -> Repro
  %% @side Logs Runbook
